---
description: Rebuild and start requestbin after finishing code edits
alwaysApply: true
---

After finishing edits in this repo, rebuild and start the server before ending the turn.

- Run `make` from the repo root. That builds `./requestbin` with `-trimpath` and `-ldflags="-s -w"` so home-directory paths stay out of the binary.
- Start `./requestbin`. Port 8080 is often taken; if it is, use `PORT=8765 ./requestbin`.
- If a previous requestbin process from this workspace is still running, stop it first so the new binary is the one listening.
- Tell the user the URL it is serving.
